### GET One entity from REST API endpoint
GET http://localhost:8090/restapi/students/11

### UPDATE entity at the REST API endpoint - will replace all properties with the properties in the request body
PUT http://localhost:8090/restapi/students/11
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 11,
  "firstName": "Justin",
  "lastName": "Rankin",
  "courseSection": "SDEV2301-1261",
  "version": 0
}
